  "description": "Hecarim's Rampage as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): in the main pack Rampage's stacks only add damage, because data cannot shorten one slot's cooldown alone (a cooldown buff cuts his charge too); with this add-on each Rampage stack he holds when he spins takes 0.75 s off that spin's cooldown. Everything else stays the main pack's. Writes a log for testing.",
